WEBVTT

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:40.360
Ying.

00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:41.440
Have you kept my words

00:01:41.440 --> 00:01:42.680
in mind?

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:45.440
Finding Master Liu is mainly to gather information.

00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:47.370
Don't clash head-on with the Japs.

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:48.130
Understood.

00:01:48.840 --> 00:01:50.400
The Japs are very cunning.

00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:52.600
You should be careful in everything.

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:53.660
Don't be reckless.

00:01:54.479 --> 00:01:55.520
Got it.

00:01:56.320 --> 00:01:57.280
In the past,

00:01:57.560 --> 00:01:59.680
I definitely wouldn't feel at ease letting you go alone.

00:01:59.680 --> 00:02:00.600
But now,

00:02:00.880 --> 00:02:02.000
I believe you have the ability

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:03.400
to complete these tasks.

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:05.040
Don't worry.

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:07.040
I will return safely.

00:02:11.360 --> 00:02:12.400
Come back soon.

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:16.520
I'm off.

00:02:31.079 --> 00:02:32.480
How is your wound?

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:33.840
It's fine.

00:02:37.480 --> 00:02:38.540
It's been two days.

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:40.180
I wonder if the contact

00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:41.840
has seen your signal.

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:43.560
Don't worry.

00:02:43.960 --> 00:02:45.160
This is a Japanese-occupied area.

00:02:45.160 --> 00:02:47.420
We must be careful with everything we do.

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:49.040
Let's go take a look.

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:51.320
In case our contact has found it,

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:53.130
they might have left a clue.

00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:53.960
Okay.

00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:01.760
The pharmacy is open.

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:04.160
I'll go in and take a look.

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:05.160
Wait for me here.

00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:06.400
Wait.

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:07.760
I'll go with you.

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:08.760
In case something goes wrong,

00:03:08.760 --> 00:03:10.420
we can look out for each other.

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:15.960
Welcome.

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:18.690
Boss, do you buy Dysosma versipellis?

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:19.980
Where are you from?

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:20.640
Shanzhou.

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:21.800
Shanzhou.

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:33.240
Are you Dysosma versipellis?

00:03:33.240 --> 00:03:34.360
My name is Cui Wenpei.

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:36.360
Dysosma versipellis is my code name.

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:37.200
Hello.

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:39.040
And this is?

00:03:39.560 --> 00:03:40.120
I am.

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:42.420
This is our newly recruited comrade.

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:44.200
Hello, comrade.

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:45.720
Hello.

00:03:46.360 --> 00:03:48.640
I am Lao Zhang, the Mianchi underground liaison.

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:49.700
This liaison point

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:51.160
has long been abandoned.

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:53.400
I came here two days ago to move things out.

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:55.000
This house was supposed to be returned,

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:56.960
but after seeing the secret signal you left me,

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:58.040
I asked my superiors for instructions.

00:03:58.040 --> 00:04:00.300
They told me to contact you immediately.

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:02.000
Comrade Cui,

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:03.260
you came from Shanzhou

00:04:03.640 --> 00:04:05.170
and left me a secret signal.

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:06.320
Is there an emergency?

00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:07.160
Lao Zhang,

00:04:07.480 --> 00:04:09.320
do you know the situation in Shanzhou?

00:04:09.320 --> 00:04:10.760
The organization doesn't know much.

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:12.920
We only know that the whole territory of Shanzhou has fallen

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:15.080
and the Party organization has been severely damaged.

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:17.160
I came here this time to report

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:19.320
the situation in Shanzhou to the Party organization.

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:21.399
Our comrades in Shanzhou are still fighting,

00:04:21.399 --> 00:04:23.240
and the united front work with the swordsmen

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:24.240
is also ongoing.

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:28.000
The secretary of the Western Henan Prefectural Party Committee happens to be in Mianchi.

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:29.320
You can go see him

00:04:29.320 --> 00:04:30.850
and report to him directly.

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:33.520
Can you arrange it?

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:35.600
I will go ask my superiors for instructions

00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:36.530
and let you know.

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:38.730
Come back again at this time tomorrow.

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:39.680
Okay.

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:40.600
Thank you, Lao Zhang.

00:04:40.600 --> 00:04:41.320
You're welcome.

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:42.360
Wait a moment.

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:46.440
Here, take it.

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:49.720
Be careful when you go out.

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:51.960
Okay, you two.

00:04:56.680 --> 00:04:57.440
Here you go.

00:04:57.840 --> 00:04:59.560
Remember to come back at this time tomorrow

00:04:59.560 --> 00:05:00.820
to get the second dose.

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:01.920
Thank you, shopkeeper.

00:05:01.920 --> 00:05:03.000
You're welcome.

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:04.360
Take care, you two.

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:17.320
Major.

00:05:17.640 --> 00:05:18.680
I remembered something

00:05:18.680 --> 00:05:20.040
that I forgot to report to you.

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:20.970
Let's go inside.

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:26.400
Major, he...

00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:32.920
What else do you have to say?

00:05:34.159 --> 00:05:35.000
Major,

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:38.040
you asked me to do my best to recruit the swordsmen.

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:39.240
I have done everything

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:40.170
you told me to do.

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:44.000
But you didn't do it well.

00:05:46.760 --> 00:05:48.960
That's because you killed innocent people

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:50.560
and chilled the swordsmen's hearts.

00:05:50.560 --> 00:05:52.280
They would rather wander away from home

00:05:52.280 --> 00:05:54.340
than return to Qinglong Stronghold.

00:05:54.840 --> 00:05:56.159
I have tried my best.

00:05:57.400 --> 00:05:58.330
Tried your best?

00:06:02.440 --> 00:06:04.040
Did you really try your best?

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:09.840
Sandao Yuan claims to have 100,000 swordsmen.

00:06:10.440 --> 00:06:12.680
But how many are there in Qinglong Stronghold now?

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:13.800
You know it best.

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:14.640
Also,

00:06:17.200 --> 00:06:19.240
I haven't got the most crucial third treasure map

00:06:19.240 --> 00:06:20.880
even now.

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:24.320
You say you have tried your best.

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:25.680
It's far from enough.

00:06:25.960 --> 00:06:27.520
I have already given you

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:28.960
the treasure maps in my hands.

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:30.440
As for the third map,

00:06:30.880 --> 00:06:32.880
I only know it's in Huo Lang's hands.

00:06:33.320 --> 00:06:36.250
You didn't find it when you attacked Qin Foye Valley.

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:37.520
What can I do?

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:42.240
Did you call me back

00:06:42.680 --> 00:06:45.680
just to explain that you have tried your best?

00:06:46.960 --> 00:06:47.760
No.

00:06:49.440 --> 00:06:50.640
I want to ask

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:53.760
where my daughter Xiaoni is.

00:06:56.960 --> 00:06:58.760
She is in a very safe place.

00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:01.560
I will arrange everything for her very well.

00:07:02.280 --> 00:07:04.600
Don't worry about your daughter anymore.

00:07:04.600 --> 00:07:05.920
Don't mention such words

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:07.600
in front of me again.

00:07:08.040 --> 00:07:08.880
Got it?

00:07:09.320 --> 00:07:10.000
Then,

00:07:11.520 --> 00:07:13.050
what about Shangguan Ying?

00:07:13.440 --> 00:07:15.440
Didn't you take them away together?

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:18.120
That's right.

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:20.160
They are together.

00:07:20.640 --> 00:07:21.480
What's wrong?

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:27.520
Tahara Masao,

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:29.290
don't lie to me anymore.

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:31.160
Where is Xiaoni exactly?

00:07:32.960 --> 00:07:33.840
Bastard!

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:41.400
You are truly unreasonable.

00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:44.440
I tell you, He,

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:46.040
as long as you obey

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:48.400
and help me continue to recruit swordsmen,

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:50.240
and look for the third treasure map,

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:53.880
I promise I won't make things difficult for you and your daughter.

00:07:53.880 --> 00:07:57.560
I warn you for the last time today.

00:07:57.960 --> 00:08:00.920
If you bother me with such stupid words again,

00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:02.920
I will kill your daughter.

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:14.320
Look at you, silly girl.

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:16.920
I just got you out of Qinglong Stronghold.

00:08:16.920 --> 00:08:18.400
Why did you come back?

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:20.220
Old Li went to Dikengyuan,

00:08:20.320 --> 00:08:22.280
and said Qinglong Stronghold was occupied by the Japanese.

00:08:22.280 --> 00:08:23.360
I had to come back and check.

00:08:23.360 --> 00:08:24.720
That was so dangerous.

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:28.280
Luckily, I followed Tahara Masao here.

00:08:28.680 --> 00:08:30.360
You were almost discovered.

00:08:30.760 --> 00:08:32.000
He Xiaobian saw me.

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:34.600
He was the one who stopped Tahara Masao.

00:08:36.440 --> 00:08:37.799
Don't mention He Xiaobian.

00:08:37.799 --> 00:08:41.000
Now that Qinglong Stronghold has fallen to Tahara Masao,

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:42.919
he played a major role.

00:08:46.320 --> 00:08:46.960
By the way.

00:08:47.240 --> 00:08:49.840
I heard Huo Lang in Qinfoyegou died.

00:08:50.320 --> 00:08:53.440
There's no survivor in Qinfoyegou.

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:56.360
I've been worried sick these days.

00:08:58.080 --> 00:08:59.520
How did you escape?

00:09:00.360 --> 00:09:01.520
Baozi and I

00:09:02.960 --> 00:09:05.220
survived at the cost of Uncle Huo's life.

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:07.880
Master Huo was a real man.

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:10.900
I thank him on behalf of the Chief.

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:15.640
He protected the last bloodline of the Shangguan family.

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:19.080
We must avenge my father,

00:09:19.800 --> 00:09:21.200
Uncle Huo, and Aunt Shui.

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:22.480
Of course.

00:09:24.560 --> 00:09:25.560
Uncle Banjin,

00:09:26.680 --> 00:09:28.440
Baozi and Uncle Liu,

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:30.680
they are all in the Dikeng Courtyard now.

00:09:30.680 --> 00:09:32.720
We have already sent out the invitations to the heroes.

00:09:32.720 --> 00:09:34.450
When our forces grow stronger,

00:09:34.680 --> 00:09:37.080
we will take back the Qinglong Stronghold.

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:38.800
Great.

00:09:39.960 --> 00:09:41.820
I've finally waited for this day.

00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:44.040
Your father asked me to guard the secret passage,

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:45.280
fearing that one day

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:47.800
something would happen to the stronghold,

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:51.080
and we could use it to launch a counterattack.

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:52.400
But before that,

00:09:52.680 --> 00:09:55.140
you must figure out the Japanese deployment

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:56.440
and their weapons.

00:10:02.480 --> 00:10:04.140
I have already figured it out.

00:10:04.960 --> 00:10:06.280
The Japs' munitions

00:10:06.760 --> 00:10:09.080
are hidden in an abandoned courtyard.

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:11.360
To attack Qinglong Stronghold,

00:10:11.680 --> 00:10:14.320
we must blow up this courtyard first.

00:10:16.560 --> 00:10:18.160
But we can't take it by force.

00:10:19.280 --> 00:10:20.810
Can you dig another tunnel?

00:10:23.440 --> 00:10:24.960
Great minds think alike.

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:27.880
I'm thinking about the same thing now.

00:10:28.240 --> 00:10:29.560
Right now in the stronghold,

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:31.420
how many of our brothers are left?

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:36.080
Compared to when your father was here,

00:10:36.080 --> 00:10:37.280
half of them are gone.

00:10:37.520 --> 00:10:40.120
Some died, some fled.

00:10:40.880 --> 00:10:42.080
Those who didn't flee

00:10:42.360 --> 00:10:45.280
either have elderly parents or young children.

00:10:45.680 --> 00:10:46.740
They had no choice.

00:10:47.920 --> 00:10:49.440
That old fox Tianyuan

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:52.610
asked He Xiaobian to help recruit swordsmen.

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:55.280
So many days have passed,

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:56.880
but few have come.

00:10:57.640 --> 00:10:59.480
Here's the plan, let's go back to the Dikeng Courtyard

00:10:59.480 --> 00:11:01.140
and tell everyone about this.

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:02.160
Okay.

00:11:05.400 --> 00:11:06.120
Boss.

00:11:06.360 --> 00:11:07.600
You two are here.

00:11:15.760 --> 00:11:17.040
Did you get in touch with the Secretary?

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:17.760
Yes, I did.

00:11:18.120 --> 00:11:19.520
It's such a coincidence.

00:11:19.600 --> 00:11:20.680
Our Secretary,

00:11:21.040 --> 00:11:22.760
his hometown is in Shanzhou.

00:11:23.920 --> 00:11:25.850
His family is from Zhangbianyuan.

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:27.320
His name is Peng Tao.

00:11:27.840 --> 00:11:28.560
Where is he?

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:30.280
You two, follow me.

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:39.680
I am Peng Tao,

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:41.920
Secretary of the Party Committee in Western Henan.

00:11:41.920 --> 00:11:43.560
I'm very glad to see you.

00:11:44.520 --> 00:11:45.450
Secretary Peng,

00:11:45.720 --> 00:11:47.720
we finally found the organization.

00:11:48.960 --> 00:11:50.360
After the fall of Shanzhou,

00:11:50.360 --> 00:11:51.760
news from there stopped.

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:53.440
You came just in time.

00:11:53.680 --> 00:11:56.200
Come, sit down and take your time.

00:12:01.960 --> 00:12:03.480
Although Shanzhou has fallen,

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:06.140
anti-Japanese activities have never stopped.

00:12:06.320 --> 00:12:08.280
Comrade Cai Baozi has been leading the swordsmen

00:12:08.280 --> 00:12:09.520
to resist the enemy.

00:12:09.840 --> 00:12:10.760
Cai Baozi.

00:12:11.560 --> 00:12:12.360
I know him.

00:12:12.720 --> 00:12:14.320
When he first arrived at Sandaoyuan,

00:12:14.320 --> 00:12:16.200
Comrade Wu Jingyuan received him.

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:17.200
How is he doing now?

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:19.000
We have organized the remaining forces

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:20.530
from various strongholds.

00:12:20.600 --> 00:12:21.720
I came here this time

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:23.960
to request our army's support

00:12:24.280 --> 00:12:25.960
to build up this force.

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:31.160
That's a very good idea.

00:12:31.440 --> 00:12:32.680
I also worked in my hometown, Shanzhou,

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:34.040
for a long time.

00:12:34.360 --> 00:12:36.320
I am very familiar with Sandaoyuan.

00:12:36.320 --> 00:12:38.800
And I also know about the Western Henan swordsmen.

00:12:38.800 --> 00:12:39.860
They are different

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:42.400
from ordinary mountain bandits.

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:44.920
If they can really be organized,

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:48.280
they will indeed be an armed force to be reckoned with.

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:51.600
I suggest breaking them up into small groups

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:53.360
to wage guerrilla warfare behind enemy lines.

00:12:53.360 --> 00:12:54.020
At present,

00:12:54.240 --> 00:12:56.480
our main forces have already relocated.

00:12:56.480 --> 00:12:59.210
The comrades left behind are doing exactly this.

00:12:59.360 --> 00:13:00.320
Secretary Peng,

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:02.960
are they the Western Henan Anti-Japanese Guerrilla

00:13:02.960 --> 00:13:04.690
Third and Fourth Detachments?

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:07.000
How did you know?

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:09.880
I heard it from Captain Yoshida

00:13:09.880 --> 00:13:11.080
of the Japanese army.

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:13.040
Comrade Cui,

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:15.280
it seems I underestimated you.

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:17.970
Your intelligence work is very thorough.

00:13:20.200 --> 00:13:20.760
Yes,

00:13:20.920 --> 00:13:22.360
it's these anti-Japanese guerrillas

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:23.880
who are active everywhere.

00:13:23.880 --> 00:13:26.120
I can ask for instructions from my superiors

00:13:26.120 --> 00:13:28.000
to merge your swordsmen anti-Japanese organization

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:30.080
into the anti-Japanese guerrillas behind enemy lines.

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:31.080
What do you think?

00:13:31.440 --> 00:13:32.570
That would be great.

00:13:33.760 --> 00:13:35.400
However, the swordsmen,

00:13:35.400 --> 00:13:37.920
after all, haven't received professional military training.

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:40.400
Moreover, they also lack weapons and ammunition.

00:13:40.400 --> 00:13:41.360
Rest assured.

00:13:41.760 --> 00:13:43.800
I will ask my superiors

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:46.200
to allocate some capable cadres to you.

00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:49.080
In addition, we will provide you with some weapons and ammunition.

00:13:49.080 --> 00:13:50.520
That's wonderful, Secretary Peng.

00:13:50.520 --> 00:13:52.120
This is exactly what we need.

00:13:52.800 --> 00:13:54.560
I will leave for Shanzhou immediately

00:13:54.560 --> 00:13:57.160
to relay the superiors' arrangement to Comrade Cai Baozi.

00:13:57.160 --> 00:13:57.920
Good.

00:13:58.640 --> 00:14:01.080
Qinglong Stronghold is easy to defend and hard to attack.

00:14:01.080 --> 00:14:01.880
Baozi,

00:14:02.240 --> 00:14:02.680
Ying'er.

00:14:02.680 --> 00:14:04.360
You're back.

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:05.360
Who did you bring?

00:14:06.040 --> 00:14:07.520
Master Liu, we meet again.

00:14:07.880 --> 00:14:10.080
Sir, Ying'er told me everything.

00:14:10.440 --> 00:14:11.760
Just give the order,

00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:13.160
I'll follow your lead.

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:13.920
Have a seat first.

00:14:13.920 --> 00:14:14.600
Sit.

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:15.360
Sit.

00:14:17.680 --> 00:14:18.440
Ying'er,

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:20.840
I can't underestimate you anymore.

00:14:20.840 --> 00:14:22.640
You have your father's style.

00:14:23.640 --> 00:14:25.960
I didn't expect you to single-handedly

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:27.560
storm the Japs' lair.

00:14:28.280 --> 00:14:29.280
Yes,

00:14:29.280 --> 00:14:30.680
our Ying'er has grown up.

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:35.570
It's all thanks to the secret passage my father left.

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:39.120
Right.

00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:40.900
About this.

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:42.040
This is a defense map

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:44.040
of Qinglong Stronghold that I drew.

00:14:44.080 --> 00:14:45.210
Come and take a look.

00:14:49.520 --> 00:14:51.160
This is Qinglong Stronghold.

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:52.220
Masao Tahara asked

00:14:52.480 --> 00:14:54.410
He Xiaobian to recruit swordsmen,

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:55.440
train them,

00:14:55.440 --> 00:14:57.570
and then send them to the battlefield.

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:02.280
Then we must beat Masao Tahara to it

00:15:02.640 --> 00:15:03.880
and capture Qinglong Stronghold.

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:05.760
We can't let his scheme succeed.

00:15:06.400 --> 00:15:07.730
It's actually not easy.

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:10.680
The disparity in strength between us is too great.

00:15:13.520 --> 00:15:15.120
Our strength is indeed weak,

00:15:15.360 --> 00:15:17.920
but I've thought of someone these past two days.

00:15:17.920 --> 00:15:18.720
Who?

00:15:20.720 --> 00:15:21.520
Cui Wenkui.

00:15:21.800 --> 00:15:22.560
Him?

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:25.240
He is not one of us.

00:15:30.800 --> 00:15:33.840
Although Cui Wenkui is not one of us,

00:15:34.840 --> 00:15:37.160
he is fighting the Japanese.

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:39.140
He has men and guns.

00:15:39.520 --> 00:15:40.640
In the face of a national crisis,

00:15:40.640 --> 00:15:42.640
we can put everything aside for now.

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:44.320
If we can unite,

00:15:44.760 --> 00:15:47.490
it's possible to take back Qinglong Stronghold.

00:15:48.360 --> 00:15:49.560
If you put it that way,

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:50.920
we can give it a try.

00:15:56.200 --> 00:15:57.330
These past few days,

00:15:57.360 --> 00:15:59.560
I've been suffocating in Qinglong Stronghold.

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:00.360
Sixth Master.

00:16:00.760 --> 00:16:02.240
Take a walk with me.

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:06.640
All right. I'll take a walk with you.

00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:07.480
Let's go.

00:16:17.840 --> 00:16:18.600
Ying'er.

00:16:22.880 --> 00:16:25.160
This was entrusted to me by Chief Huo before he died,

00:16:25.160 --> 00:16:26.490
the third treasure map.

00:16:26.720 --> 00:16:28.120
I'm giving it to you now.

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:30.400
You must keep it safe.

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:32.320
Uncle Huo gave this to you.

00:16:32.320 --> 00:16:33.780
Why are you giving it to me?

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:37.050
The old chief originally left it for your father.

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:39.200
It's the wealth of Qinglong Stronghold.

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:41.120
It's only right to leave it to you.

00:16:42.200 --> 00:16:43.800
My father gave this map to you

00:16:43.920 --> 00:16:45.320
for a reason.

00:16:46.840 --> 00:16:48.970
We don't have time to argue about this.

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:50.960
I'm going to see Cui Wenkui.

00:16:50.960 --> 00:16:53.160
It's not convenient to carry it with me.

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:56.840
Keep it safe.

00:16:59.520 --> 00:17:01.880
It's dangerous for you to see Cui Wenkui.

00:17:05.520 --> 00:17:06.760
Just in case.

00:17:07.839 --> 00:17:08.880
This treasure map

00:17:09.200 --> 00:17:11.800
must not fall into the Japanese's hands again.

00:17:11.880 --> 00:17:14.079
Shanzhou City has already been occupied by them.

00:17:14.079 --> 00:17:16.599
If the treasure map falls into their hands again,

00:17:16.599 --> 00:17:18.920
they will loot all our wealth.

00:17:20.119 --> 00:17:21.040
So,

00:17:22.160 --> 00:17:23.800
you must keep it safe.

00:17:24.119 --> 00:17:25.450
Don't give it to anyone.

00:17:25.720 --> 00:17:26.640
Got it?

00:17:39.400 --> 00:17:40.930
What is your business here?

00:17:42.480 --> 00:17:43.080
Excuse me,

00:17:43.640 --> 00:17:45.040
is Brigade Commander Cui Wenkui

00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:46.040
stationed here?

00:17:46.320 --> 00:17:47.320
Go away.

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:48.530
Hurry up.

00:17:48.600 --> 00:17:49.280
Leave now.

00:17:50.440 --> 00:17:50.880
Go.

00:17:51.640 --> 00:17:53.320
The Kuomintang is corrupt

00:17:53.480 --> 00:17:55.280
and passive in fighting the Japanese.

00:17:55.280 --> 00:17:57.080
Although Wenkui belongs to the Kuomintang...

00:17:57.080 --> 00:18:00.140
But he never hesitates when it comes to fighting Japan.

00:18:00.400 --> 00:18:02.000
I have to find a way to convince him

00:18:02.000 --> 00:18:03.440
to join our team

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:05.040
to fight Japan together.

00:18:26.360 --> 00:18:27.220
Brigadier Cui,

00:18:28.480 --> 00:18:29.680
you're so relaxed.

00:18:32.080 --> 00:18:33.000
No need to look.

00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:34.480
It's just me.

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:36.610
How did you find this place?

00:18:37.040 --> 00:18:39.920
Nothing is impossible to a willing heart.

00:18:40.600 --> 00:18:41.720
But finding you

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:44.240
was full of twists and turns.

00:18:45.040 --> 00:18:46.360
Psycho.

00:18:46.720 --> 00:18:49.850
You could have done anything else instead of finding me.

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:51.660
I really didn't expect

00:18:51.840 --> 00:18:55.440
that the majestic brigadier of the National Army's Independent Brigade is now unemployed

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:58.040
and running to the river to cultivate his mind.

00:18:58.200 --> 00:19:00.120
Put away your reverse psychology.

00:19:00.120 --> 00:19:01.480
It doesn't work on me.

00:19:01.760 --> 00:19:03.800
Don't mention the Independent Brigade to me.

00:19:03.800 --> 00:19:05.800
The Independent Brigade has long been incorporated by Zhang Gongyan.

00:19:05.800 --> 00:19:07.200
And I'm not a brigadier.

00:19:07.920 --> 00:19:08.800
See?

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:10.600
I'm just an idler.

00:19:12.640 --> 00:19:13.720
Where is this?

00:19:15.080 --> 00:19:16.210
Shanzhou District.

00:19:17.000 --> 00:19:18.930
It's the Japanese-occupied area.

00:19:19.480 --> 00:19:22.080
You and I are both slaves of a conquered nation.

00:19:23.840 --> 00:19:25.720
No, you're wrong.

00:19:26.400 --> 00:19:27.720
I'm not like you.

00:19:28.800 --> 00:19:30.440
Although Shanzhou City has fallen,

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:33.120
we haven't stopped resisting for a moment.

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:34.600
Even the swordsmen here

00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:36.560
have organized to fight Japan.

00:19:37.280 --> 00:19:38.540
I really didn't expect

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:41.120
that as a senior general of the National Army,

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:42.560
you could be so decadent.

00:19:45.880 --> 00:19:47.010
It's not decadence.

00:19:48.760 --> 00:19:50.160
I just can't see any hope.

00:19:50.280 --> 00:19:52.210
It's because you stick to one path,

00:19:52.480 --> 00:19:53.600
unwilling to accept reality,

00:19:53.600 --> 00:19:55.240
unwilling to admit that your choice is wrong,

00:19:55.240 --> 00:19:56.840
and unwilling to correct it.

00:19:57.160 --> 00:19:58.480
Shut up!

00:20:13.520 --> 00:20:14.400
Cui Wenkui.

00:20:14.840 --> 00:20:16.300
I understand how you feel.

00:20:16.560 --> 00:20:19.640
Zhang Gongyan gives you a hard time and pushes you aside.

00:20:19.640 --> 00:20:22.520
He makes you lose prestige in front of your superiors,

00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:24.440
as if your hands and feet were tied.

00:20:24.440 --> 00:20:26.920
But none of this is unchangeable.

00:20:27.560 --> 00:20:29.090
You need to use your actions

00:20:29.320 --> 00:20:30.650
to prove your strength.

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:34.160
The Japanese garrison in Shanzhou is not large right now.

00:20:34.160 --> 00:20:35.480
I have also gathered the scattered swordsmen

00:20:35.480 --> 00:20:36.610
and organized them.

00:20:36.680 --> 00:20:38.280
If we add your strength

00:20:38.280 --> 00:20:39.720
and unite together

00:20:39.720 --> 00:20:42.000
to find a chance to fight them hard,

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:46.170
we will definitely deal a heavy blow to the Japanese devils.

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:11.180
Think about it carefully.

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:12.860
We still have a chance now.

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:16.480
While the Japanese army hasn't gained a firm foothold

00:21:16.480 --> 00:21:19.360
and isn't familiar with the situation here,

00:21:20.600 --> 00:21:21.880
let's go all out

00:21:22.520 --> 00:21:23.800
and fight them.

00:21:26.200 --> 00:21:28.460
Let me know when you've made up your mind.

00:21:29.160 --> 00:21:30.200
Where to find me,

00:21:30.760 --> 00:21:31.760
you already know.

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:35.440
I'm off.

00:22:24.880 --> 00:22:25.340
Sister.

00:22:25.480 --> 00:22:26.200
Come in.

00:22:27.760 --> 00:22:29.360
I brought you some peanuts.

00:22:29.800 --> 00:22:30.800
Have some.

00:22:31.680 --> 00:22:32.480
Okay.

00:22:34.040 --> 00:22:35.880
Sister, what is this?

00:22:36.240 --> 00:22:37.080
This

00:22:38.320 --> 00:22:39.650
is Uncle Huo Er's relic.

00:22:40.240 --> 00:22:42.170
Baozi temporarily left it with me.

00:22:43.280 --> 00:22:44.680
Such an important thing,

00:22:45.120 --> 00:22:46.440
you shouldn't keep it on you.

00:22:46.440 --> 00:22:47.840
Let me put it away for you.

00:22:48.520 --> 00:22:49.400
You're right.

00:22:52.920 --> 00:22:53.680
Here.

00:22:55.200 --> 00:22:57.260
Then sister, I'll put it here for you.

00:22:57.760 --> 00:22:58.480
Okay.

00:23:10.040 --> 00:23:10.800
Stop!

00:23:12.320 --> 00:23:14.120
What are you looking around for?

00:23:16.760 --> 00:23:17.890
You're a swordsman?

00:23:19.080 --> 00:23:20.410
You have a good eye, kid.

00:23:20.800 --> 00:23:22.800
You don't look like an ordinary civilian.

00:23:22.800 --> 00:23:23.760
Speak. What's your business?

00:23:23.760 --> 00:23:25.920
If I'm not an ordinary civilian, then what am I?

00:23:25.920 --> 00:23:27.520
I think you're either a scout

00:23:27.760 --> 00:23:28.800
or a spy.

00:23:29.280 --> 00:23:30.940
Brother, you misunderstood.

00:23:31.200 --> 00:23:32.400
Misunderstood what?

00:23:32.400 --> 00:23:33.860
Move. Come inside with me.

00:23:35.240 --> 00:23:35.880
Wu Laoliu.

00:23:36.080 --> 00:23:37.480
How dare you call Master Six by his name?

00:23:37.480 --> 00:23:38.940
Move. Come inside with me.

00:23:39.360 --> 00:23:39.890
Alright.

00:23:40.080 --> 00:23:41.880
Then take me to see your Master Six.

00:23:41.880 --> 00:23:43.400
Go. Keep moving. Behave yourself.

00:23:43.400 --> 00:23:44.460
Don't look around.

00:23:46.360 --> 00:23:47.160
Hey, buddy.

00:23:47.600 --> 00:23:48.800
I haven't seen you before.

00:23:48.800 --> 00:23:49.840
Are you new here?

00:23:50.600 --> 00:23:51.840
Look at this. A new knife.

00:23:51.840 --> 00:23:53.500
Master Six gave it to us today.

00:23:54.160 --> 00:23:55.280
Very impressive.

00:23:55.920 --> 00:23:57.650
Behave yourself. Keep moving.

00:23:57.760 --> 00:23:58.520
Okay.

00:24:02.720 --> 00:24:03.560
Three.

00:24:05.400 --> 00:24:06.120
Five.

00:24:07.320 --> 00:24:08.000
Six.

00:24:08.400 --> 00:24:10.000
Sixth Master! Sixth Master!

00:24:10.280 --> 00:24:11.740
Let everyone take a break.

00:24:13.520 --> 00:24:14.680
Brother, you're back.

00:24:14.680 --> 00:24:16.010
I'm back, Sixth Master.

00:24:16.560 --> 00:24:18.720
Sixth Master, you assigned me to guard duty on the first day,

00:24:18.720 --> 00:24:19.720
and I caught a spy.

00:24:21.360 --> 00:24:22.400
Brother Ma,

00:24:22.720 --> 00:24:24.160
he's no spy.

00:24:24.160 --> 00:24:25.440
He's our Boss Cai.

00:24:25.440 --> 00:24:26.640
Say hello to Boss Cai.

00:24:28.600 --> 00:24:29.200
Sixth Master.

00:24:29.200 --> 00:24:30.000
Boss Cai,

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:31.360
my old eyes are failing me.

00:24:31.360 --> 00:24:32.640
I mistook you for a spy.

00:24:32.640 --> 00:24:33.480
I'm sorry.

00:24:33.480 --> 00:24:34.610
It's fine, brother.

00:24:36.160 --> 00:24:38.680
Sixth Master, I actually think this brother here...

00:24:38.680 --> 00:24:39.740
Very responsible.

00:24:39.760 --> 00:24:41.800
The enemies are watching us closely.

00:24:41.800 --> 00:24:43.760
It doesn't hurt to be careful.

00:24:44.040 --> 00:24:44.720
Right.

00:24:45.760 --> 00:24:46.560
All right, Ma.

00:24:46.840 --> 00:24:48.560
You can go back to your work now.

00:24:48.560 --> 00:24:49.690
I'm sorry, Boss Cai.

00:24:49.960 --> 00:24:50.880
It's fine.

00:24:54.800 --> 00:24:55.460
Master Six.

00:24:55.880 --> 00:24:57.920
How did I become Boss Cai?

00:24:58.320 --> 00:24:59.320
After you left,

00:24:59.640 --> 00:25:00.770
we all discussed it.

00:25:01.720 --> 00:25:03.520
We're all willing to follow you.

00:25:03.720 --> 00:25:04.480
It's a promising future.

00:25:04.480 --> 00:25:06.160
So, if we don't call you Boss Cai,

00:25:06.160 --> 00:25:07.160
what should we call you?

00:25:07.160 --> 00:25:08.080
Besides,

00:25:08.080 --> 00:25:09.940
didn't we call you Boss Wu before?

00:25:10.800 --> 00:25:12.920
You didn't know my identity before.

00:25:13.400 --> 00:25:15.360
So I answered to Boss Wu.

00:25:15.680 --> 00:25:16.640
But now,

00:25:16.640 --> 00:25:18.240
you all know I'm a Communist.

00:25:18.320 --> 00:25:19.280
In our army,

00:25:19.280 --> 00:25:20.680
we don't use such titles.

00:25:22.680 --> 00:25:24.320
But we are in Sandaoyuan now.

00:25:24.640 --> 00:25:26.480
This is how we do things here.

00:25:29.880 --> 00:25:31.540
Anyway, let's talk business.

00:25:32.160 --> 00:25:34.800
Did you see Cui Wenkui this time?

00:25:36.760 --> 00:25:37.640
I did.

00:25:38.160 --> 00:25:39.320
Let's talk about it when we get back.

00:25:39.320 --> 00:25:39.920
Let's go.

00:25:40.520 --> 00:25:42.800
Brothers, take a break and then continue practicing.

00:25:42.800 --> 00:25:44.080
Okay.

00:25:52.800 --> 00:25:54.400
Finding Cui Wenkui this time

00:25:54.480 --> 00:25:56.010
really took a lot of effort.

00:25:57.360 --> 00:25:58.800
Baozi! Baozi!

00:26:00.400 --> 00:26:03.000
You're finally back. We were worried to death.

00:26:04.440 --> 00:26:05.240
You

00:26:05.680 --> 00:26:07.160
made my niece so anxious.

00:26:07.520 --> 00:26:09.640
She ran to the village entrance dozens of times a day.

00:26:09.640 --> 00:26:10.440
Uncle Six.

00:26:10.960 --> 00:26:12.440
Don't listen to Uncle Six's nonsense.

00:26:12.440 --> 00:26:13.500
Sit down, sit down.

00:26:13.960 --> 00:26:14.640
Tell us.

00:26:14.640 --> 00:26:16.370
How are things with Cui Wenkui?

00:26:18.640 --> 00:26:20.170
Seeing Cui Wenkui this time

00:26:20.280 --> 00:26:21.480
really surprised me.

00:26:21.800 --> 00:26:23.800
He lost all his former high spirits.

00:26:24.040 --> 00:26:26.170
He has become completely dispirited.

00:26:26.480 --> 00:26:27.680
How could this happen?

00:26:27.680 --> 00:26:30.480
He and Division Commander Zhang Gongyan have always been at odds.

00:26:30.480 --> 00:26:32.960
It seems the conflict has intensified this time.

00:26:32.960 --> 00:26:35.240
He has become a commander without troops.

00:26:35.240 --> 00:26:37.080
I told him about our idea.

00:26:37.880 --> 00:26:39.360
He didn't give a clear answer.

00:26:39.360 --> 00:26:40.920
But judging from his expression,

00:26:40.920 --> 00:26:42.080
he wants to resist the Japanese.

00:26:42.080 --> 00:26:44.280
He is just restricted by Zhang Gongyan.

00:26:45.560 --> 00:26:46.520
So,

00:26:46.960 --> 00:26:48.760
he still didn't agree to join us.

00:26:48.800 --> 00:26:50.240
Even though he hasn't agreed,

00:26:50.240 --> 00:26:51.560
it just depends on whether Cui Wenkui

00:26:51.560 --> 00:26:53.560
has the courage to take this step.

00:26:54.280 --> 00:26:56.680
What if this guy doesn't cooperate?

00:26:57.240 --> 00:26:59.160
We have to do it without him.

00:26:59.880 --> 00:27:01.040
Wenpei and Yuanshangfei

00:27:01.040 --> 00:27:02.440
have been gone for a while.

00:27:02.440 --> 00:27:04.500
I wonder if they've found the troops.

00:27:04.560 --> 00:27:07.120
If we have troops to support us, it'll be better.

00:27:07.120 --> 00:27:08.080
If not,

00:27:08.080 --> 00:27:09.610
we have to find another way.

00:27:10.240 --> 00:27:11.360
Now Qinglong Stronghold

00:27:11.360 --> 00:27:13.440
has been turned into a fortress by Masao Tahara.

00:27:13.440 --> 00:27:15.120
Blocking one side of Sandao Yuan,

00:27:15.120 --> 00:27:16.400
our troops can't get in.

00:27:16.400 --> 00:27:18.240
The Japs can use it as a base

00:27:18.240 --> 00:27:19.520
and continue marching west.

00:27:19.520 --> 00:27:20.520
With Cui Wenkui,

00:27:20.520 --> 00:27:22.840
our weapons and equipment will be more sufficient.

00:27:22.840 --> 00:27:23.880
Without him,

00:27:24.560 --> 00:27:26.320
it might take some effort.

00:27:27.520 --> 00:27:28.650
Getting men is easy.

00:27:29.160 --> 00:27:30.160
These days,

00:27:30.160 --> 00:27:32.520
there are quite a few swordsmen coming to join us from all over.

00:27:32.520 --> 00:27:34.120
But what we lack are weapons.

00:27:34.480 --> 00:27:35.840
To attack Qinglong Stronghold,

00:27:35.840 --> 00:27:38.560
we can't just take these few broadswords

00:27:38.560 --> 00:27:40.840
to fight against the Japs' guns and cannons.

00:27:40.840 --> 00:27:42.520
The most urgent thing right now

00:27:42.520 --> 00:27:45.480
is to find a way to get guns and ammunition.

00:27:45.760 --> 00:27:46.400
Yes.

00:27:46.960 --> 00:27:47.760
Exactly.

00:27:48.240 --> 00:27:49.080
This matter,

00:27:49.520 --> 00:27:51.240
we'll discuss it further.

00:27:53.160 --> 00:27:54.600
This is to let you reflect.

00:27:54.600 --> 00:27:55.840
And to protect you.

00:27:55.840 --> 00:27:58.000
Otherwise, with your desertion,

00:27:58.000 --> 00:27:59.960
how can I explain it to the soldiers?

00:27:59.960 --> 00:28:01.880
Even if you go to fight the Japanese,

00:28:01.880 --> 00:28:03.520
we still have to obey military discipline, right?

00:28:03.520 --> 00:28:04.520
Besides,

00:28:06.040 --> 00:28:08.200
haven't you already been reinstated?

00:28:08.200 --> 00:28:09.160
Commander,

00:28:09.160 --> 00:28:10.800
you called me here today

00:28:10.800 --> 00:28:13.440
not just for my reinstatement, right?

00:28:13.440 --> 00:28:14.500
You guessed right.

00:28:19.240 --> 00:28:22.960
The current situation in Shanzhou is very grim.

00:28:23.720 --> 00:28:25.600
Grim?

00:28:25.600 --> 00:28:27.200
Shanzhou has been captured.

00:28:27.600 --> 00:28:28.760
The Japanese have driven us

00:28:28.760 --> 00:28:30.600
to such a remote place.

00:28:30.600 --> 00:28:33.880
One more step and we're out of Shanzhou.

00:28:33.880 --> 00:28:35.680
What could be grimmer than this?

00:28:40.880 --> 00:28:43.120
Why do you have to speak so harshly?

00:28:44.760 --> 00:28:46.760
What do you mean by being driven out?

00:28:47.600 --> 00:28:49.460
We call this a strategic retreat.

00:28:50.320 --> 00:28:52.520
That's what our newspapers say.

00:28:52.880 --> 00:28:55.440
War is not about fighting for a piece of land

00:28:55.720 --> 00:28:57.000
or a city.

00:28:57.000 --> 00:28:59.200
It's about the layout of a grand strategic plan.

00:28:59.200 --> 00:29:00.400
All right.

00:29:00.400 --> 00:29:02.460
Commander, don't tell me about this.

00:29:04.440 --> 00:29:05.840
I don't blame you either.

00:29:05.960 --> 00:29:07.480
This was decided by our superiors.

00:29:07.480 --> 00:29:09.080
We just need to execute it.

00:29:10.520 --> 00:29:12.200
The airport has been lost.

00:29:12.840 --> 00:29:15.160
We can only hold this position now.

00:29:16.080 --> 00:29:17.360
The airport is lost?

00:29:18.200 --> 00:29:19.240
Exactly.

00:29:19.720 --> 00:29:20.960
I'm thinking,

00:29:20.960 --> 00:29:22.920
since our position is quite remote,

00:29:22.920 --> 00:29:24.320
we can hold it for a while.

00:29:24.840 --> 00:29:26.440
When reinforcements arrive,

00:29:26.440 --> 00:29:28.560
we will redeploy our strategic plan.

00:29:30.520 --> 00:29:31.240
In this way,

00:29:31.520 --> 00:29:34.120
let's make a strategic deployment in advance.

00:29:34.560 --> 00:29:35.720
Catch them off guard,

00:29:35.720 --> 00:29:37.850
and maybe we can take the airport back.

00:29:37.960 --> 00:29:39.720
Taking the airport back isn't that simple.

00:29:39.720 --> 00:29:42.380
It's better than sitting and waiting for death.

00:29:42.440 --> 00:29:43.640
Let me think about it.

00:29:46.760 --> 00:29:48.090
Brigade Commander Cui.

00:29:49.400 --> 00:29:51.960
If I go back to the rear to request support.

00:29:52.360 --> 00:29:53.760
You take command for me.

00:29:54.920 --> 00:29:57.760
Are you confident in holding this position?

00:30:18.360 --> 00:30:20.490
Not to mention holding this position,

00:30:22.560 --> 00:30:25.160
even if I personally lead the men to fight back,

00:30:25.840 --> 00:30:27.040
I wouldn't hesitate.

00:30:27.360 --> 00:30:28.280
All right.

00:30:29.320 --> 00:30:30.800
Go back and prepare.

00:30:31.880 --> 00:30:33.120
I'll think it over.

00:30:50.680 --> 00:30:51.440
Who is it?

00:30:51.680 --> 00:30:53.280
Brigade Commander, it's me.

00:30:54.760 --> 00:30:55.560
Come in.

00:30:59.000 --> 00:30:59.660
Commander.

00:31:02.520 --> 00:31:04.400
I knew you brat would come find me.

00:31:05.120 --> 00:31:05.680
I knew it.

00:31:05.680 --> 00:31:07.320
Zhang Gongyan wouldn't dare do anything to you.

00:31:07.320 --> 00:31:09.320
You're reinstated now, aren't you?

00:31:10.080 --> 00:31:11.760
If I stay here like this any longer,

00:31:11.760 --> 00:31:13.020
I'll be bored to death.

00:31:13.800 --> 00:31:14.480
Tell me,

00:31:14.760 --> 00:31:16.360
what have you heard outside?

00:31:16.640 --> 00:31:18.200
I saw unusual troop movements,

00:31:18.200 --> 00:31:19.560
so I asked a fellow townsman.

00:31:19.560 --> 00:31:21.920
He said Zhang Gongyan is going to run away.

00:31:22.280 --> 00:31:24.040
Probably because the Japanese are coming.

00:31:24.040 --> 00:31:25.640
He's taking his core troops.

00:31:25.880 --> 00:31:27.610
I guess they'll leave tonight.

00:31:29.160 --> 00:31:30.080
When he came to me today

00:31:30.080 --> 00:31:31.400
to reinstate me,

00:31:31.400 --> 00:31:32.640
I guessed as much.

00:31:32.960 --> 00:31:34.200
That coward.

00:31:35.800 --> 00:31:37.060
What else did you hear?

00:31:37.600 --> 00:31:39.240
The soldiers below are very dissatisfied.

00:31:39.240 --> 00:31:40.640
They are all cursing him.

00:31:45.440 --> 00:31:46.240
Who is it?

00:31:46.760 --> 00:31:50.290
Commander Cui, the Division Commander wants you for a meeting.

00:31:50.640 --> 00:31:51.440
Now?

00:31:51.760 --> 00:31:52.480
Yes.

00:31:54.920 --> 00:31:55.720
Got it.

00:31:57.680 --> 00:31:58.520
Let's go.

00:32:01.360 --> 00:32:02.720
Those who came today

00:32:03.160 --> 00:32:06.420
are all my old subordinates who have followed me for years.

00:32:07.200 --> 00:32:08.640
I called everyone here

00:32:09.440 --> 00:32:12.600
to discuss the current situation.

00:32:14.880 --> 00:32:17.880
Our division is currently trapped here,

00:32:18.440 --> 00:32:21.040
too far away from the main force.

00:32:21.440 --> 00:32:22.640
Shanzhou has fallen.

00:32:22.960 --> 00:32:24.090
Our communications

00:32:24.360 --> 00:32:26.560
will soon be intercepted by the Japanese.

00:32:26.560 --> 00:32:30.200
So I just made a major decision.

00:32:30.520 --> 00:32:33.520
We must risk breaking through the Japanese defense line,

00:32:33.520 --> 00:32:35.120
return to our rear,

00:32:35.600 --> 00:32:37.660
meet the military region commander,

00:32:38.000 --> 00:32:40.860
and ask for instructions on how to retake Shanzhou.

00:32:41.000 --> 00:32:42.080
That's one thing.

00:32:42.560 --> 00:32:43.400
Secondly,

00:32:43.800 --> 00:32:46.600
request support for personnel and supplies.

00:32:47.560 --> 00:32:49.800
Commander, since a big battle is imminent,

00:32:49.800 --> 00:32:52.200
who will command the troops when you leave?

00:32:54.280 --> 00:32:55.720
That's a good question.

00:32:56.720 --> 00:32:59.440
The second purpose of our gathering today

00:33:00.240 --> 00:33:01.440
is to talk about this.

00:33:02.240 --> 00:33:03.600
While I leave the camp

00:33:03.920 --> 00:33:05.560
and return to the rear,

00:33:06.040 --> 00:33:10.240
the camp will be managed and commanded by Commander Cui.

00:33:10.960 --> 00:33:12.080
Commander Cui.

00:33:12.360 --> 00:33:13.890
Why should he be in command?

00:33:14.080 --> 00:33:15.000
Actually,

00:33:15.720 --> 00:33:17.240
before I came to Shanzhou,

00:33:18.640 --> 00:33:20.840
Commander Cui had arrived a step ahead,

00:33:21.040 --> 00:33:23.570
and is very familiar with the situation here.

00:33:23.920 --> 00:33:25.600
Cui Wenkui used to be from the independent brigade.

00:33:25.600 --> 00:33:27.040
Why should we listen to his command?

00:33:27.040 --> 00:33:28.900
Exactly. He just got reinstated.

00:33:32.720 --> 00:33:33.640
Commander Cui,

00:33:35.160 --> 00:33:37.560
do you have anything to say to the brothers?

00:33:37.880 --> 00:33:39.280
I'll listen to the Division Commander.

00:33:39.280 --> 00:33:40.680
Then I'll say a few words.

00:33:42.040 --> 00:33:43.570
Several of you present here

00:33:44.240 --> 00:33:47.200
graduated from the same military academy as me.

00:33:48.000 --> 00:33:50.520
Some are even several grades senior to me.

00:33:51.440 --> 00:33:53.320
Regarding the Division Commander's appointment,

00:33:53.320 --> 00:33:55.880
you might not be convinced.

00:33:57.320 --> 00:33:58.840
Of course, the Division Commander doesn't have to use me.

00:33:58.840 --> 00:34:00.680
I can take my brigade and leave.

00:34:01.680 --> 00:34:03.760
But I, Cui Wenkui, want to ask you guys,

00:34:03.760 --> 00:34:06.720
who is more qualified to stay here than me?

00:34:09.600 --> 00:34:11.199
Who among you is more

00:34:11.199 --> 00:34:13.659
familiar with Shanzhou's terrain than I am?

00:34:13.679 --> 00:34:17.159
Which of you in the Shanzhou area

00:34:18.159 --> 00:34:20.000
has fought the Japanese?

00:34:21.199 --> 00:34:22.600
And which of you has dealt

00:34:23.040 --> 00:34:26.159
with Tahara Masao of the Special Higher Police

00:34:26.159 --> 00:34:27.719
face-to-face?

00:34:29.760 --> 00:34:30.520
You?

00:34:31.159 --> 00:34:31.880
You?

00:34:34.000 --> 00:34:34.840
Any of you?

00:34:37.120 --> 00:34:38.199
If you don't,

00:34:38.719 --> 00:34:40.280
just shut your mouth.

00:34:40.840 --> 00:34:42.040
Listen to my command.

00:34:45.760 --> 00:34:49.020
I believe in Brigade Commander Cui's ability and courage.

00:34:49.120 --> 00:34:52.179
He will definitely lead everyone to hold this position

00:34:52.520 --> 00:34:54.719
and wait for reinforcements to arrive.

00:34:57.000 --> 00:34:59.130
Division Commander, the car is ready.

00:34:59.640 --> 00:35:00.440
Okay.

00:35:01.320 --> 00:35:04.250
I'll leave this place to you, Brigade Commander Cui.

00:35:05.520 --> 00:35:07.080
I will depart immediately.

00:35:23.760 --> 00:35:25.560
This bastard.

00:35:48.600 --> 00:35:50.200
Blow the whistle and fall in.

00:35:51.200 --> 00:35:52.320
Brigade Commander,

00:35:52.320 --> 00:35:54.040
isn't it too early?

00:35:56.720 --> 00:35:57.920
Where is the sun?

00:35:59.080 --> 00:36:02.280
Zhang Gongyan's troops have always been undisciplined.

00:36:03.320 --> 00:36:05.780
Since the troops have been handed over to me,

00:36:06.520 --> 00:36:08.000
they must follow my rules.

00:36:08.160 --> 00:36:08.920
Yes, sir.

00:36:12.560 --> 00:36:13.840
Fall in!

00:36:22.280 --> 00:36:23.040
Who is it?

00:36:24.480 --> 00:36:25.200
Who is this?

00:36:25.920 --> 00:36:26.980
What are you doing?

00:36:28.080 --> 00:36:29.280
Why get up so early?

00:36:32.120 --> 00:36:34.480
What's going on this early?

00:36:52.960 --> 00:36:53.720
Attention!

00:36:59.720 --> 00:37:02.160
Look at your appearance in the mirror.

00:37:02.760 --> 00:37:05.220
Do you look like an army that can win a battle?

00:37:05.960 --> 00:37:08.120
I don't care how Division Commander Zhang led you before.

00:37:08.120 --> 00:37:10.880
Now that he has handed you over to me,

00:37:11.240 --> 00:37:13.040
you have to follow my rules.

00:37:14.080 --> 00:37:15.480
From now on, at morning exercise,

00:37:15.480 --> 00:37:17.520
whoever is late or slacks off

00:37:17.520 --> 00:37:19.050
will be severely punished.

00:37:19.200 --> 00:37:21.360
Of course, if you violate military discipline,

00:37:21.360 --> 00:37:23.280
military law will be waiting for you.

00:37:23.280 --> 00:37:23.960
I know

00:37:24.280 --> 00:37:25.920
some of you are thinking that

00:37:26.480 --> 00:37:27.880
here with me, Cui Wenkui,

00:37:28.600 --> 00:37:29.680
you can

00:37:30.840 --> 00:37:31.840
pull some strings

00:37:32.000 --> 00:37:33.130
and spend some money

00:37:33.520 --> 00:37:35.600
to smooth things over.

00:37:35.600 --> 00:37:37.330
Let me make this clear upfront.

00:37:37.880 --> 00:37:39.160
I, Cui Wenkui,

00:37:41.880 --> 00:37:43.040
won't fall for that.

00:37:44.400 --> 00:37:46.360
From now on, training for each company

00:37:46.360 --> 00:37:47.480
must be recorded by roll call.

00:37:47.480 --> 00:37:48.540
Do you understand?

00:37:48.840 --> 00:37:49.800
Understood!

00:37:49.800 --> 00:37:50.730
Start training!

00:37:51.360 --> 00:37:54.320
Right turn! Double time, march!

00:38:00.440 --> 00:38:03.280
Brigade Commander, your trick is quite effective.

00:38:03.280 --> 00:38:04.560
If we don't show them who's boss,

00:38:04.560 --> 00:38:06.160
they won't know their place.

00:38:08.200 --> 00:38:09.660
The troops are scattered.

00:38:12.160 --> 00:38:12.840
Do this.

00:38:13.080 --> 00:38:15.610
Find a few veterans from our brigade command,

00:38:15.800 --> 00:38:16.600
disguise them as civilians,

00:38:16.600 --> 00:38:18.860
and go gather some intel on the Japanese.

00:38:19.800 --> 00:38:21.330
Alright, I'll go right now.

00:38:22.960 --> 00:38:24.000
Be careful.

00:38:24.320 --> 00:38:25.080
Yes, sir.

00:38:47.440 --> 00:38:49.600
Our home is gone.

00:38:50.080 --> 00:38:52.480
Hurry up. I want to go home.

00:38:54.680 --> 00:38:57.240
What should we do now that our home is gone?

00:39:02.440 --> 00:39:04.440
Don't be too sad, sir.

00:39:05.080 --> 00:39:07.940
These damn Japanese devils came to steal our grain.

00:39:08.000 --> 00:39:11.240
These were the seeds saved for next spring.

00:39:11.600 --> 00:39:14.440
We can't live like this. How are we supposed to survive?

00:39:14.440 --> 00:39:15.840
Our houses are gone.

00:39:16.280 --> 00:39:18.040
Our sons are gone too.

00:39:18.480 --> 00:39:19.200
Sir,

00:39:19.520 --> 00:39:21.360
was your village the only one robbed?

00:39:21.360 --> 00:39:23.560
They only stole this much from our village.

00:39:23.560 --> 00:39:25.890
Tomorrow they will go to the next village.

00:39:26.400 --> 00:39:28.560
No village will be able to escape.

00:39:28.960 --> 00:39:30.080
If you resist,

00:39:30.400 --> 00:39:33.120
they will burn your house and take your people.

00:39:33.600 --> 00:39:35.720
We can't live like this.

00:39:35.720 --> 00:39:37.920
All our homes are gone.

00:39:41.280 --> 00:39:43.240
Damn Japanese.

00:39:55.120 --> 00:39:56.120
Hurry.

00:39:59.680 --> 00:40:00.320
Hurry up.

00:40:01.640 --> 00:40:02.360
Let's go.

00:40:04.360 --> 00:40:06.490
These civilians are all homeless now.

00:40:07.360 --> 00:40:09.040
Those hateful devils.

00:40:10.560 --> 00:40:13.220
We need to hurry up and find Baozi and the others.

00:40:13.720 --> 00:40:15.600
Will they be at the place you mentioned?

00:40:15.600 --> 00:40:16.400
I'm sure of it.

00:40:16.680 --> 00:40:18.080
That's a stronghold

00:40:18.080 --> 00:40:19.600
jointly built by our major factions.

00:40:19.600 --> 00:40:21.120
If something major happens,

00:40:21.120 --> 00:40:23.080
it's the safest hiding place.

00:40:23.440 --> 00:40:24.320
Let's go.

00:40:30.880 --> 00:40:32.080
Loot the grain!

00:40:32.560 --> 00:40:34.520
Three villages were robbed along the way.

00:40:34.520 --> 00:40:35.520
When I arrived at Shanzhou City,

00:40:35.520 --> 00:40:37.480
there was no movement at the Japanese camp.

00:40:37.480 --> 00:40:39.740
I only saw supply trucks going in and out.

00:40:41.160 --> 00:40:42.560
These bastards.

00:40:42.800 --> 00:40:45.360
They're pushing the common people to death.

00:40:45.720 --> 00:40:46.980
You can say that again.

00:40:49.920 --> 00:40:50.680
No.

00:40:51.200 --> 00:40:52.800
This might be a good opportunity.

00:40:52.800 --> 00:40:53.530
Listen to me.

00:40:54.040 --> 00:40:55.520
Go to the Dikengyuan and find Cai Baozi.

00:40:55.520 --> 00:40:56.650
Tell him about this.

00:40:56.680 --> 00:40:57.210
Tell him?

00:40:57.400 --> 00:40:57.720
Yes.

00:40:57.920 --> 00:40:58.520
Cai Baozi?

00:40:58.600 --> 00:40:59.120
Yes.

00:40:59.320 --> 00:41:00.400
Didn't he come to me a while ago,

00:41:00.400 --> 00:41:01.800
wanting to unite and fight the Japs?

00:41:01.800 --> 00:41:03.800
How many men can Cai Baozi possibly have?

00:41:03.800 --> 00:41:05.330
He dares to boast like that.

00:41:06.080 --> 00:41:07.520
Never mind how many men he has.

00:41:07.520 --> 00:41:08.840
It's a troop at least.

00:41:08.840 --> 00:41:09.960
Go tell him now.

00:41:09.960 --> 00:41:11.320
He knows what I want to do,

00:41:11.320 --> 00:41:12.560
and he knows what to do.

00:41:12.560 --> 00:41:13.280
Go.

00:41:13.600 --> 00:41:14.400
Go!

00:41:14.640 --> 00:41:15.400
Yes, sir.

00:41:27.520 --> 00:41:28.200
I'm telling you,

00:41:28.200 --> 00:41:29.130
I know your boss.

00:41:29.200 --> 00:41:30.200
Cut the crap. Let's go.

00:41:30.200 --> 00:41:31.000
Brother Cai.

00:41:31.600 --> 00:41:32.520
Brother Cai.

00:41:34.360 --> 00:41:37.120
What a warm welcome you have here.

00:41:38.880 --> 00:41:40.010
Platoon Leader Zhu.

00:41:41.880 --> 00:41:42.680
You're in plain clothes.

00:41:42.680 --> 00:41:44.410
I almost didn't recognize you.

00:41:44.880 --> 00:41:45.800
We know each other.

00:41:45.800 --> 00:41:46.840
You can go back to work.

00:41:46.840 --> 00:41:47.560
Yes, sir.

00:41:48.280 --> 00:41:49.440
Come, please sit.

00:41:49.440 --> 00:41:50.440
Please sit. Okay.

00:41:51.560 --> 00:41:52.720
Platoon Leader Zhu, we all know each other,

00:41:52.720 --> 00:41:54.850
so there's no need for introductions.

00:41:56.200 --> 00:41:57.280
Platoon Leader Zhu,

00:41:57.280 --> 00:41:58.800
how did you find me here?

00:41:59.760 --> 00:42:01.520
Our brigade commander asked me to find you

00:42:01.520 --> 00:42:03.000
to pass on a message.

00:42:03.440 --> 00:42:04.640
The Japanese army in Shanzhou

00:42:04.640 --> 00:42:07.440
has been robbing nearby villages of grain lately.

00:42:11.760 --> 00:42:14.320
You mean the Japs are robbing the villages?

00:42:14.600 --> 00:42:15.200
Yes.

00:42:15.440 --> 00:42:16.480
So,

00:42:16.480 --> 00:42:17.960
the Japs' claws

00:42:17.960 --> 00:42:19.760
will reach us soon.

00:42:20.400 --> 00:42:22.080
You are far from the county.

00:42:22.480 --> 00:42:24.960
It seems the Japs haven't noticed you yet.

00:42:26.360 --> 00:42:28.480
What does your Brigade Commander Cui mean?

00:42:28.480 --> 00:42:30.480
Our brigade commander wants to hear your opinion.

00:42:30.480 --> 00:42:31.680
Is that even a question?

00:42:31.680 --> 00:42:33.720
Don't hesitate. If they come, we fight.

00:42:33.720 --> 00:42:34.600
Fight?

00:42:36.040 --> 00:42:37.120
How?

00:42:38.160 --> 00:42:40.560
Your Brigade Commander Cui is testing me, isn't he?

00:42:40.560 --> 00:42:42.520
Our commander is quite cautious.

00:42:42.800 --> 00:42:44.760
So he wants to hear your opinion.

00:42:45.960 --> 00:42:46.800
Alright.

00:42:47.360 --> 00:42:48.840
I'll give you a general idea.

00:42:48.840 --> 00:42:49.770
Pass it on to him.

00:42:50.320 --> 00:42:52.320
The Japs coming to sweep the village

00:42:52.320 --> 00:42:53.560
won't bring many men.

00:42:53.800 --> 00:42:55.400
We can set up an ambush in advance.

00:42:55.400 --> 00:42:56.760
Catch them off guard,

00:42:57.080 --> 00:42:58.240
and don't linger in battle.

00:42:58.240 --> 00:43:00.880
We'll just grab the stuff and run.